    <string name="listening_tips">LISTENING TIPS</string>
    <string name="tip_one">Sit close and name the colour your child taps. Colour words and sounds settle together.</string>
    <string name="tip_two">Let a wrong tap pass without comment. The mole simply plays the phrase again, slower.</string>
    <string name="tip_three">Two or three songs in one sitting is plenty for a toddler. Short and happy beats long and tired.</string>
    <string name="tip_four">Hum the phrase back yourself before your child answers. Copying a voice is easier than copying a bar.</string>

